# Working notes holding live Google credentials — the Gmail OAuth client
# secret and the refresh token for the Amaze sending mailbox. These sat
# untracked but unignored at the repository root, which meant a single
# `git add -A` would have published them to a public GitHub repo. Listed by
# bare filename rather than anchored to the root, so a copy made in any
# subdirectory is ignored too.
Google OAuth Web.txt
Google Mail Server Details.txt
Backend/supervisor.pid
